Inline Common Citizenship
    documentation "Contains information relative to U.S. citizenship status and its associated probationary documentation."
    descriptor CitizenshipStatus
        documentation "An indicator of whether or not the person is a U.S. citizen."
        is required
    descriptor Visa
        documentation "An indicator of a non-US citizen's Visa type."
        is optional collection
    common IdentificationDocument
        documentation "Describe the documentation of citizenship."
        is optional collection
